; PSXLook preset: extreme
; Past what the hardware actually did. Halved snap grid and 3-bit colour, for demonstrating the range and stress-testing a scene.
; Every value is written out explicitly, even where it matches the script
; default, so this file states the whole look rather than inheriting half of it.
